            "detailed_description": "An unexplained break-in in the small hamlet of Prescott Lane draws the attention of Dr. Doyle, a man of questionable morality and unreserved inquisitiveness, who realises from the first that things aren't exactly how they seem.<br><br>After the body of an ex-convict is found beaten to death in a dark alley, it is up to the Doctor to put the pieces together.<br><br>Armed with his straps and his wits, the good Doctor sets out to find the truth and solve the mystery of the cloche hat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tInvestigate 1920s Dover, England (with over 80 interactive hotspots)</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tGather Clues and Combine them with the Environment and the Characters you Meet</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tChoose your Method in your Encounters</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\tMake Assumptions, Reach Conclusions and Decide the Guilty Party</li></ul>",
